# raymath's scalar helpers (Clamp/Lerp/Remap/Wrap) are intentionally
# NOT bound: they're one-liners in kaikai, and binding them under
# common names like `clamp` collides with a caller's own `clamp` on
# the native backend. Write them inline instead.
